Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.52,0:10:02.43,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Welcome to ProSeka AfterTalk: "Grow Glorious Glow" edition!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.04,0:10:04.32,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.88,0:10:07.80,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'm Rina Honnizumi, the voice of Shizuku Hinomori from MORE MORE JUMP!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:22.96,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,This ProSeka AfterTalk is a program where we look back on the event story and enjoy the AfterLive together!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:27.40,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,This time, we're covering the "Grow Glorious Glow" event.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.92,0:10:35.52,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,The event just ended a moment ago, but did you all check it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.52,0:10:36.68,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,What did you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.68,0:10:41.68,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'll be keeping an eye on the comments, so please join in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:52.05,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I actually jotted down some notes earlier about some things I really wanted to talk about,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.05,0:10:55.70,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,so I'm hoping to go over those with you all a bit later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.70,0:10:57.52,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,But yeah, this story really blew me away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:11:03.40,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Both MMJ and Shizuku herself have overcome so many hurdles,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.40,0:11:06.52,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,and even though she'd already said she wanted to grow wings and take flight,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.52,0:11:08.40,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,she's still finding new ways to surpass herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.48,0:11:11.08,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,There's no stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:12.24,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:21.80,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,So, please post your thoughts on the event or the stream using the hashtag #ProSekaAfterTalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.80,0:11:25.62,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,The staff have set up the YouTube chat so I can see it right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.62,0:11:28.38,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,so I'll be picking out comments that catch my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.38,0:11:29.86,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Let's see... ah, good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.86,0:11:31.20,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.88,0:11:35.98,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,The staff have provided me with a device again today,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.98,0:11:42.64,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,so I'd like to look back at the story and the member illustrations with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.28,0:11:50.04,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Also, I'll be creating a private room to watch the AfterLive together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.04,0:11:54.78,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'll share the Room ID at 9:55 PM, so I'll let you know then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.78,0:12:01.50,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'll announce it again closer to the starting time, so please get your devices ready so we can watch it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.50,0:12:04.28,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I hope you'll all join in! Let's get started!
Comment: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:14.02,Shizuku,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Story Watchalong ===
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:16.90,Shizuku,host_meta,0,0,0,,Now then, I'd like to look back on the story of "Grow Glorious Glow,"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.90,0:12:22.36,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,but first, I want to watch one episode together with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:23.12,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Just one episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.48,0:12:29.00,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I feel like opinions might be split.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.00,0:12:29.84,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Just a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.88,0:12:36.84,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,But I was actually thinking I'd like to watch Episode 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:38.52,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,What do you all think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.12,0:12:41.56,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Please let me know in the comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.24,0:12:46.64,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Oh, you're already saying "7"! Everyone is so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.64,0:12:47.66,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:52.06,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,So Episode 7 is good? 7 it is. I'll go with your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.06,0:12:53.40,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:58.76,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Alright, let's watch Episode 7 together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.19,0:13:00.69,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.00,0:13:03.34,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm the one who has to start it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.34,0:13:04.30,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:06.24,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have said "here we go!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.79,0:13:07.50,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.50,0:13:08.88,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'll start it now.
Comment: 0,0:21:24.00,0:21:25.32,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,"I won't lose!"
Comment: 0,0:21:26.96,0:21:30.04,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Hagiyama-chan is seriously such a good girl.
Comment: 0,0:21:32.44,0:21:33.12,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.40,0:21:38.41,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,And there we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.41,0:21:40.40,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,Ah— that's where the episode ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:44.56,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,That was the moment they recognized each other as rivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.36,0:21:49.00,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,So that was Episode 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:49.65,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,That went by so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.65,0:21:50.38,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,That went by so fast!
Comment: 0,0:21:50.38,0:21:51.72,Shizuku,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.38,0:21:51.72,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,So that's where it ends!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.32,0:21:59.76,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Actually, I really love the part that comes after this, when the commercial finally airs,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.76,0:22:02.12,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,and everyone is at Momo House watching it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.12,0:22:04.56,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Saito-san's reaction was also pretty great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.56,0:22:11.08,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I also love seeing Minori-chan getting all excited and squealing. She's so pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.08,0:22:12.10,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,But that's all for the watchalong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.10,0:22:14.56,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for watching with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.52,0:22:19.26,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I have so much I want to say, but we need to watch the live show at 9:55 PM,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.26,0:22:23.00,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,so everyone, please keep an eye on the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.00,0:22:28.12,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I might just keep yapping endlessly and lose track of the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.12,0:22:33.08,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,but there's so much I really wanted to talk about, so I'll squeeze as much in here as time allows.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.08,0:22:35.00,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Where should I start?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.20,0:22:48.44,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I have a few favorite scenes that weren't in the episodes we just watched, so let's review.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.44,0:22:51.95,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,So Hagiyama-san from ReLight ended up in the commercial with Shizuku,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.95,0:22:56.36,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,but she actually appeared previously in the Idol Lovers Festival event.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.36,0:23:02.34,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,So I feel like they'll continue to foster a good, healthy rivalry with MMJ,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.34,0:23:07.30,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,and it was great to see her and Shizuku meet like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.18,0:23:14.70,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,But here, she appears again as Shizuku's rival while they're co-starring as models.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.70,0:23:21.46,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,They're both stepping up their game, and I'm really looking forward to seeing them both in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:23.52,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Also, regarding Shizuku's past...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.16,0:23:32.96,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,There were several flashback scenes. I can't remember exactly which exact episodes they were in,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.96,0:23:37.72,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,but I'd love for everyone to go back and watch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.72,0:23:42.36,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,A junior member from her Cheerful＊Days era appears to greet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.08,0:23:54.56,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Back then, Shizuku was being produced as a mysterious idol and was completely overwhelmed with work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.56,0:23:59.82,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It was a really painful time for her, and she worked so hard to push through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.82,0:24:03.95,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,And then, this new junior member joined.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.95,0:24:07.56,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,She said she had worked so hard to join because she looked up to her seniors.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.56,0:24:11.56,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,There's a scene where she goes up to Shizuku and says that she's going to do her best too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.56,0:24:15.48,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,At that time, Shizuku was already...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.08,0:24:21.94,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,She was feeling really down, thinking she wasn't suited to be the center of Cheerful＊Days.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.94,0:24:28.74,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,But by meeting that junior, she realized she was carrying the future of those girls on her shoulders too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.74,0:24:35.00,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,She decided that if she lacked confidence, she had to keep improving herself until she finally found it.
Comment: 0,0:24:35.00,0:24:35.50,Shizuku,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.00,0:24:35.85,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,This almost...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.92,0:24:39.56,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,this almost felt like a fated encounter, with her junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.44,0:24:43.80,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,That's a scene that really moved me,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.36,0:24:47.84,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,one of my favorites from this event.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.84,0:24:51.84,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, and the MMJ members too...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.84,0:24:56.87,Shizuku,,0,0,0,,When Shizuku passed the audition,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.08,0:25:01.63,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,she was practicing all by herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.92,0:25:05.74,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,and they brought her some refreshments.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.74,0:25:10.42,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,We get to see that a bit in the card stories,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.42,0:25:11.99,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,that— how to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.60,0:25:14.92,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,that sense of distance between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.84,0:25:25.52,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Airi especially knows Shizuku well from when she was in Cheerful＊Days,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.12,0:25:31.22,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,so she can tell how serious Shizuku is without a single word.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.22,0:25:35.64,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,That's why Airi, without even asking her anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.64,0:25:37.08,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,is able to understand what she's feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.08,0:25:47.83,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It really makes me realize what wonderful girls the MMJ members are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.52,0:25:54.30,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Shizuku was like a tightly wound string,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.30,0:25:56.72,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,there was so much tension in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.32,0:26:12.46,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It felt a bit precarious, but Airi was happy to see the Shizuku who was the center of Cheerful＊Days again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.46,0:26:14.20,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It's so emotional, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.32,0:26:19.90,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,But Airi also knows just how much Shizuku suffered back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.90,0:26:21.68,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,She doesn't say it to her face, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.52,0:26:27.95,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,but she's watching over her growth, including all of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.95,0:26:29.55,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,That's just how close they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.60,0:26:37.12,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,During the recording, I was honestly thinking, "Thank you so much for writing this."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.32,0:26:43.39,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Looking at the comments... everyone's saying "They really trust each other."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.76,0:26:51.56,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Oh yeah! Also, in the second part of Shizuku's side story,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.44,0:26:54.38,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,where Shizuku made onigiri for the rest of MMJ in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.38,0:27:02.00,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,But yeah, they were all thinking about what each of them could do for Shizuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.00,0:27:06.85,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,They knew she was being really strict with her diet,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.85,0:27:12.95,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,so they brought her high-nutrition, low-fat meals as refreshments.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.95,0:27:15.30,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,That's true love.
Comment: 0,0:27:15.30,0:27:16.24,Shizuku,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.30,0:27:16.59,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It's all about supporting each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.28,0:27:19.31,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I mean... ah, looks like I have a bit more time to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.84,0:27:24.23,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,What should I talk about next...
Comment: 0,0:27:27.52,0:27:29.12,Shizuku,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Song Watchalong ===
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.52,0:27:31.71,Shizuku,host_meta,0,0,0,,So, that Grand Fleur commercial...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.71,0:27:35.05,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,they showed the live shot of Shizuku doing the recording, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.36,0:27:39.02,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,What did you think of it, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.02,0:27:46.82,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,So when I record for the game, I usually record my lines alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.82,0:27:55.15,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It seems Hagiyama-san's VA had already finished her voice recording,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.15,0:27:57.40,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,but we had some lines that had to be in sync.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.40,0:28:03.62,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,There was a part where Hagiyama-san and Shizuku say "Grand Fleur" together.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.62,0:28:11.08,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Normally, for lines in unison, they play the previously recorded voice into my headphones,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.08,0:28:16.98,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,and I listen to that while recording my part to match the timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.98,0:28:23.58,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,That's the usual way we get those nice synchronized lines,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.58,0:28:24.16,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,but get this!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.16,0:28:26.52,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I recorded that without listening at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.52,0:28:29.84,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,And yet, it was so perfectly in sync!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.84,0:28:31.92,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I was so surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.92,0:28:37.92,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I only got to see the final in-game version at the same time as all of you, but I was blown away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.92,0:28:45.34,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I got an "OK" right away. I thought I might have to redo it,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.34,0:28:51.88,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,but I guess Hagiyama-chan and Shizuku were just naturally on the same wavelength.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.88,0:28:55.60,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I can't believe that actually happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.60,0:29:01.70,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,The lines were actually quite long, too, like "The new Floraison Éclat..."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.70,0:29:06.22,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I actually looked up what kind of color "Floraison Éclat" was.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.22,0:29:08.60,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Turns out it's a really beautiful floral color.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.44,0:29:11.54,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I was so surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.54,0:29:13.91,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'm glad everyone is saying they were wowed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.44,0:29:19.35,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I feel like it was a small miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.88,0:29:28.88,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It makes me happy that these two, who met as friendly rivals, could be so in sync.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.12,0:29:37.44,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I hope they continue to push each other to new heights with the girls from ReLight.
Comment: 0,0:29:37.44,0:29:38.12,Shizuku,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.68,0:29:43.59,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I think we have a bit more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.96,0:29:53.00,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Going back to talking about the flashback scenes again,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.62,0:30:00.82,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,but there was a part when Shizuku was searching for what it was she was lacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.82,0:30:06.77,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It was around the scene when Shizuku decides to watch some old footage in her room,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.77,0:30:11.70,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,and then Miku-chan calls out to her asking what's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.70,0:30:20.10,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,In that scene where she watches footage from her Cheerful＊Days era, we get to hear a bit from past Shizuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.10,0:30:21.76,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,She was muttering to herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.76,0:30:25.44,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,like "I need to do it more like this..."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.60,0:30:32.40,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,We actually recorded several different patterns for that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.40,0:30:36.76,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,And we picked out the very best one for all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.36,0:30:43.58,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,As for what the patterns were like... there was one where she sounded a little more precarious,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.58,0:30:48.20,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,like a Shizuku who would make you worried just by looking at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.08,0:30:52.98,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,She was really pushing herself there,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.98,0:31:02.32,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,feeling she had to perfect her dancing to carry the weight of being the center of Cheerful＊Days.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.32,0:31:04.44,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Almost like it was her very last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.80,0:31:11.64,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,We recorded a few patterns of that desperate Shizuku, and I felt like...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.64,0:31:18.74,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Well, we've seen Shizuku push herself like this a few times before,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.74,0:31:23.28,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,but it's been a while since she's put so much pressure on herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.28,0:31:26.14,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,There were several scenes that were actually pretty painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.14,0:31:32.13,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Especially those almost flashbacks to her time in Cheerful＊Days.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.13,0:31:37.10,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,There's a lot of lines where she's pushing herself too hard. Those can be painful even for me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.10,0:31:41.64,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,But that Shizuku is what led us to the Shizuku we have today.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.64,0:31:45.23,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,That gap creates more of a sense of drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.76,0:31:56.75,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,That "cornered" Shizuku has a certain charm to her, in her own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.64,0:32:03.12,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Especially since she was being promoted as the "mysterious Shizuku" back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.12,0:32:06.40,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,and she never showed all that effort she was putting in under the surface.
Comment: 0,0:32:07.72,0:32:16.72,Shizuku,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.72,0:32:15.02,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Seeing how she kept working so hard in silence behind the scenes,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.02,0:32:21.12,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,it really makes you feel how lonely she was, working so hard all on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.12,0:32:26.19,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,And that connects back to the story about her Cheerful＊Days juniors I mentioned earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.59,0:32:33.24,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,where Shizuku feels like she has to work hard for their sake as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.49,0:32:38.88,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,When I think about all she went through, I'm so glad she met MMJ.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.65,0:32:42.16,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Seriously, thank you Minori,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.80,0:32:43.68,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,thank you Haruka,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.32,0:32:45.98,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,and thank you Airi...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.84,0:32:54.58,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's about time for me to get ready for the AfterLive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.58,0:33:01.82,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'll reveal the room ID around 9:55, so everyone, please get your phones ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.82,0:33:02.59,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,No rush though.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.49,0:33:05.32,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,We'll all join at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.56,0:33:10.92,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Gotta be careful not to mess up making the room here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.51,0:33:15.00,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Creating the room...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.92,0:33:27.72,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,So now I'll write down the room number.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.41,0:33:30.36,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'm not showing them yet, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.20,0:33:32.40,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'll reveal it in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.00,0:33:35.96,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Please have your phones ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.88,0:33:38.48,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It'll be around 9:55.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.36,0:33:48.24,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Oh whoops, it won't fit the page, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.50,0:33:50.11,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.64,0:33:52.80,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Right, six digits.
Comment: 0,0:34:09.28,0:34:10.76,Shizuku,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.28,0:34:11.11,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I managed to write it down without any mistakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.84,0:34:14.96,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Is everyone ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.88,0:34:19.58,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Type it in and enter on the count of three!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.58,0:34:23.04,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,There are only so many slots in the room, so it'll be first-come, first-served.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.92,0:34:25.32,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.32,0:34:30.04,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I really want us all to get hyped together!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.04,0:34:31.92,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It's the first time everyone's hearing this song, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.76,0:34:33.70,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'm so excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.70,0:34:37.56,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It's my first time seeing it too, how amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.38,0:36:36.80,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,The AfterLive starts at 10:00 PM!
Comment: 0,0:36:37.80,0:36:43.40,Shizuku,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Card Illustrations ===
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.80,0:36:43.40,Shizuku,host_meta,0,0,0,,So, I know we're going to go over the card art right after this,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.40,0:36:44.44,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,but earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.04,0:36:47.46,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I was so surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.46,0:36:53.52,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,When I saw the illustration used for Shizuku's banner, I was like,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.52,0:36:58.16,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,"Wait, is this really the untrained version?"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.60,0:37:01.52,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It feels like a trained art!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.52,0:37:02.56,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I was so surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.56,0:37:07.76,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Actually, I got a look at it during the voice recording session,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.76,0:37:10.52,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,as a reference for how Shizuku looked during that scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.03,0:37:12.49,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,And man,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.84,0:37:14.92,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,it was so—
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.92,0:37:16.80,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I just started clapping. It was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.56,0:37:20.46,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I really wish they'd actually sell these cosmetics.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.46,0:37:24.59,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,She was just amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.80,0:37:34.40,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,We've seen cool versions of Shizuku in a few events before,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.40,0:37:38.99,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,but there's a different sparkle in her eyes this time, a real sense of her strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.84,0:37:44.92,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,You can really see all of Shizuku's hard work reflected in her expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.92,0:37:46.20,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,She looked so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.76,0:37:49.04,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,And the trained art is amazing too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.56,0:37:56.88,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,She looks like she's about to take off flying into the big blue sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.88,0:38:00.47,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at the cards together later.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.47,0:38:01.58,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,They're incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.58,0:38:03.31,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,The outfits are cute too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.92,0:38:06.48,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Also the hotel was...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.64,0:38:09.92,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Was it a hotel?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.08,0:38:15.71,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,The script says it's a studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.88,0:38:18.20,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It's such a...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.88,0:38:29.34,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I thought the set really fit the concept this time. It feels very mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.34,0:38:36.68,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,But since they wanted to attract a younger audience than Grand Fleur's usual target demographic...
Comment: 0,0:38:36.68,0:38:41.40,Shizuku,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.68,0:38:41.40,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,so that's why Hagiyama-chan and Shizuku were recruited for the ad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.40,0:38:46.16,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,And they fit the concept so perfectly that it just made me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.68,0:38:56.00,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,ProSeka really shows us so many different sides of the characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.52,0:38:59.12,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Seriously, speaking as a fan myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.64,0:39:03.04,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'm so glad to see such a wide range for the characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.60,0:39:06.68,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,"I bet there were people who literally fell out of their chairs."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.68,0:39:07.64,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Are you ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.64,0:39:08.57,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,But yeah I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.76,0:39:11.74,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Falling off your chair is a normal reaction. Her performance was mindblowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.74,0:39:13.16,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, that was surprising too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.60,0:39:18.16,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I saw it was even trending on X.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.16,0:39:24.20,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I thought, "This must be for ProSeka," when the banner was revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.20,0:39:27.96,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I happened to be looking at X right at that moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.96,0:39:34.96,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,right when the official account posted the image of Shizuku's banner for this event.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.96,0:39:37.84,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Thank you for all the love, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.84,0:39:41.12,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It made me happy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.12,0:39:43.22,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It's almost time to start, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.22,0:39:44.82,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,About 10 seconds left.
Comment: 0,0:39:44.82,0:39:44.82,Shizuku,,0,0,0,,~~~START WATCHALONG~~~
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.82,0:39:46.08,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.08,0:39:47.16,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'm so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.80,0:39:51.16,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'm going to enjoy this with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.16,0:39:51.71,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.32,0:39:53.52,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.00,0:47:46.20,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,.
Comment: 0,0:47:48.08,0:47:50.44,Shizuku,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Song Watchalong ===
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.08,0:47:50.44,Shizuku,host_meta,0,0,0,,So, what did everyone think?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.32,0:47:56.34,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Usushioshisuu-san wrote this new song for MMJ,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.34,0:47:57.90,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,"Hashiru! Tooku! Todoku!"
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.92,0:48:01.88,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,When Shizuku says,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.68,0:48:05.52,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,"Look at me."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.88,0:48:10.16,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,We've never seen such a strong Shizuku before.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.32,0:48:14.56,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I was so moved, I started crying. I really did.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.64,0:48:18.72,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,In the lyrics for the chorus,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.24,0:48:22.28,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,it says, "You already know who the lead is, don't you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.92,0:48:25.96,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,She's telling everyone to look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.16,0:48:34.50,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I feel like... earlier, Shizuku mentioned that since joining MORE MORE JUMP!, she's been relying on everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.50,0:48:39.54,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,or rather, she described it as "spoiling herself."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.54,0:48:45.80,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,But that's definitely not a bad thing; it's a form of progress for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.80,0:48:54.48,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,But, she chose to call it "spoiling herself" and decided to aim for even greater heights,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.36,0:49:01.50,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,and Usushioshisuu-san wrote a song and lyrics that perfectly symbolize that growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.50,0:49:04.00,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Usushioshisuu-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.84,0:49:13.10,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,By the way, once it's added to the game, you should definitely pay attention to the lyrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.10,0:49:14.20,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,How should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.20,0:49:15.48,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,In the final chorus?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.92,0:49:23.20,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,After the first chorus, there's a solo section where everyone comes to the center one by one, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.20,0:49:27.02,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Wasn't that super cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.02,0:49:33.12,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,The part where Shizuku comes to the center and turns back...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.72,0:49:39.72,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I really felt like the choreography and formations were just god-tier.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.72,0:49:44.00,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,The lighting, the stage... and the outfits too.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.00,0:49:45.52,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,The outfits were amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.76,0:49:47.38,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.38,0:49:54.02,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I mentioned the cards briefly, but you can see it in the cards too, so later, let's all...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.02,0:49:55.64,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,let's all freak out over them together.
Comment: 0,0:49:55.64,0:49:57.88,Shizuku,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.64,0:49:57.88,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for all the comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.88,0:49:59.41,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Everyone's crying a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.52,0:50:01.78,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I totally get it though...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.60,0:50:04.80,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,The outfits were so cute too.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.80,0:50:07.48,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,They really catch your eye, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.32,0:50:14.06,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,The song also makes me excited for MMJ's future.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.06,0:50:14.96,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.92,0:50:21.33,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,And with that, the 3DMV will be uploaded to the official ProSeka YouTube channel at—
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.33,0:50:26.78,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Ah, it just went live now! It's scheduled to premiere at 10:10 PM,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.78,0:50:28.20,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,so it's already live!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.20,0:50:30.04,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Please go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.04,0:50:34.88,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Well, since you're here, I'd love for you to stay and watch the rest of this stream with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.88,0:50:37.96,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,and then you can go watch the MV as many times as you want afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.96,0:50:40.84,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,But if you really want to see it right now, go ahead and watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.84,0:50:43.04,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'm so excited for the 3DMV!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.71,0:50:45.04,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Please check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.04,0:50:47.36,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,That was all for "Hashiru! Tooku! Todoku!". Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.64,0:50:53.44,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm so glad we can deliver another new song to everyone like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.08,0:50:59.68,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,So moving on, we have five new card illustrations newly added for this event.
Comment: 0,0:50:59.68,0:51:03.44,Shizuku,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Card Illustrations ===
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.68,0:51:03.44,Shizuku,host_meta,0,0,0,,Did everyone check out the illustrations and side stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.44,0:51:06.88,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at the members right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.76,0:51:08.28,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.96,0:51:10.76,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.44,0:51:12.88,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}First up is Shizuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.04,0:51:16.92,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}This is the trained art...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.92,0:51:18.00,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Here is the trained version.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.92,0:51:23.12,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Isn't the vibe of this outfit just incredible?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.92,0:51:26.40,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}She's really taking flight, for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.40,0:51:29.38,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I love the expression Shizuku has as she looks back.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.38,0:51:31.72,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I think everyone can relate to this feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.32,0:51:35.00,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}You can really feel her strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.56,0:51:41.38,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And these... should I call them banners? These flags...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.38,0:51:43.04,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Can you tell they're shaped like wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.04,0:51:45.34,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}On the left side over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.34,0:51:51.82,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}In the past stories, Shizuku's been associated with swan metaphors,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.82,0:52:00.74,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}about how they look elegant above the water but are paddling like crazy underneath.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.74,0:52:05.78,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I think that fits Shizuku really well. It's a great metaphor,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.78,0:52:12.36,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}and this illustration really makes me think of that. It's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.06,0:52:15.24,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Next, here is the untrained version.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.24,0:52:16.28,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}This art was on the banner
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.28,0:52:22.42,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Isn't this art crazy good!? We saw it in the story earlier, and it blew me away like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.42,0:52:24.16,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And she's–
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.16,0:52:25.88,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}The set behind her, it's so sparkly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.28,0:52:30.16,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}The level of expression just keeps getting better and better.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.16,0:52:38.08,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And let me buy those cosmetics she's holding there! I want them for myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.76,0:52:41.20,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}She's just too beautiful.
