Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.08,0:52:43.34,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I could look at this forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.04,0:52:44.64,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.80,0:52:49.78,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Maybe I should use this makeup as a reference. Actually though!
Comment: 0,0:52:47.70,0:52:49.78,Shizuku - PiP,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.78,0:52:52.38,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And I also really like how she has her hair up in the back like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.38,0:52:55.96,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Ah, by the way, since Shizuku has such a mature look this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.96,0:52:59.52,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I actually had my hair done a bit more maturely too.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.52,0:53:04.55,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I couldn't help but put in some effort since Shizuku is so beautiful here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.28,0:53:06.20,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.00,0:53:07.96,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}That was Shizuku!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.00,0:53:12.32,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Next is Minori-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.32,0:53:14.56,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}The trained art– ah so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.56,0:53:15.94,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}She's bursting with energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.94,0:53:23.75,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I love Minori-chan's jumps. She's always the one bouncing around the most during lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.75,0:53:25.56,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}She really does embody MMJ.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.40,0:53:30.72,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Minori-chan's jumping power and her determination really reach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.56,0:53:33.52,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I love her so much, she's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.20,0:53:43.42,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I can't get enough of this angle too–
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.42,0:53:45.14,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Ah, look at her shoes, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.14,0:53:47.08,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}There are wings on the heels of the shoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.82,0:53:48.58,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Isn't that awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.58,0:53:52.84,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}You can really feel the attention to detail in the small things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.40,0:53:54.60,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.60,0:53:59.34,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}The designs are slightly different for each member, so I can't help but look closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.34,0:54:02.48,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And look look look!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.08,0:54:06.85,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}So guys, I know we just watched Episode 7 together,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.85,0:54:08.84,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}but make sure to watch the rest of the story too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.84,0:54:16.13,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}This is from when they all watch the aired Grand Fleur commercial together.
