Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.56,0:54:25.48,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Airi's expression too. She's kind of like "Go get 'em, Shizuku!"
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.12,0:54:28.28,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Isn't it cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.28,0:54:30.78,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Thank you so much, Minori-chan.
Comment: 0,0:54:32.16,0:54:37.04,Shizuku - PiP,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.16,0:54:37.04,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Also, look at the background. Isn't that the Momo House?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.00,0:54:42.48,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I've never seen the Momo House from this angle before.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.48,0:54:47.28,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I was like, "Ah that's what the Momo House is like". It looks super cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.52,0:54:52.70,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Next up is Miku-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.70,0:54:57.40,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}You can really feel a strong sense of determination from this Miku.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.16,0:54:59.72,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.32,0:55:07.56,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}We see so many different expressions from Miku based on how determined she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.56,0:55:11.32,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}This time, it's almost like she's carrying Shizuku's resolve right along with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.32,0:55:14.98,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Miku really stuck by Shizuku the whole time this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.98,0:55:19.06,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}It was so nice seeing how close and supporting she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.06,0:55:25.26,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And Shizuku hit it out of the park thanks to that support.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.26,0:55:27.24,Shizuku - PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}She's such a goddess. She really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.84,0:55:29.88,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Miku looks so cool too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.92,0:55:32.63,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}She looks so strong. Doesn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.20,0:55:36.54,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I really love this cool Miku too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.24,0:55:40.96,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Thank you for all the comments, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.96,0:55:45.20,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And here's the untrained art of Miku and Shizuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.80,0:55:50.38,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}This is from the scene we saw earlier... wait, not that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.38,0:55:51.88,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}This was from...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.20,0:56:02.16,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I mentioned it earlier, it's from when the two of them are watching the old footage of Shizuku practicing her dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.16,0:56:07.20,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}It's Miku staying close to her while they check the screen together.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.20,0:56:08.72,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I love the distance between them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.72,0:56:11.68,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}She's watching over her from so close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.40,0:56:15.35,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}This art is right from that moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.35,0:56:24.11,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}where she tells her that the old Shizuku...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.11,0:56:30.24,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}where she tells her that the old Shizuku is also the same Shizuku she is today.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.24,0:56:36.69,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Shizuku watches her old self and says, "That doesn't feel like me,"
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.69,0:56:41.72,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}but Miku tells her, "This is the same 'you', Shizuku."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.24,0:56:45.16,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}It's such a heartwarming scene.
Comment: 0,0:56:45.16,0:56:48.00,Shizuku - PiP,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.16,0:56:48.00,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}It really shows that she's not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.92,0:56:51.44,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Thank you for always supporting her, Miku-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.56,0:56:55.48,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}It makes me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.40,0:56:57.71,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Moving on...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.52,0:57:02.16,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Here is Haruka-chan's trained art.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.40,0:57:05.16,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}She's sitting down in this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.76,0:57:06.56,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}This is so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.08,0:57:09.64,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}This one also shows her watching over Shizuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.20,0:57:16.14,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Everyone understands Shizuku so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.14,0:57:17.92,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Well, they all understand each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.24,0:57:22.00,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Units are just so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.28,0:57:29.48,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Shizuku is here because of everyone, and everyone is here because of Shizuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.52,0:57:32.64,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Seriously, it's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.92,0:57:35.42,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Thank you so much everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.42,0:57:36.64,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I can't stop saying thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.24,0:57:40.60,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}This white MMJ three-leaf clover is nice too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.96,0:57:46.25,Shizuku - PiP,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Even if the color is a bit different in each card,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.25,0:57:49.72,Shizuku - PiP,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}it feels like everyone's all connected under the same blue sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.72,0:57:52.25,Shizuku - PiP,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}almost as if to cheer on Shizuku as she takes flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.25,0:57:53.66,Shizuku - PiP,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And that blue looks so good on everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.66,0:57:54.84,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}It's like Haruka's color.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.60,0:57:58.40,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}It's so lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.96,0:58:02.02,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I also personally like those shorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.02,0:58:07.36,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I know Shizuku has different lengths on her left and right legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.36,0:58:12.05,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}But here, you can see the... the so-called "absolute territory" part right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.44,0:58:13.72,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.64,0:58:18.40,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Haruka-chan looks great in shorts too.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.20,0:58:20.28,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}No surprises there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.08,0:58:24.36,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Oh yeah! And this illustration is just...
