Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.88,0:58:27.34,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}This is the untrained art.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.34,0:58:37.44,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}We get to see Haruka making this nutritious, low-calorie meal for Shizuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.44,0:58:38.60,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}She's so into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.40,0:58:44.30,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}We know Haruka-chan is someone very into dieting,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.30,0:58:49.46,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}so she's naturally very knowledgeable about eating healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.46,0:58:52.56,Shizuku - PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}She probably knows the nutrition values of just about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.56,0:58:57.65,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I actually learn a lot myself just by reading the script.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.28,0:59:01.08,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Like, 'this is a bit high in fat,' or—
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.25,0:59:03.65,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}what was it again...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.65,0:59:04.68,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Right, keto diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.68,0:59:07.42,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Something like 'This is a sweet you can eat even on a keto diet.'
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.42,0:59:13.74,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I'm like, 'Oh, I see,' and I even save it as a reference sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.74,0:59:18.82,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Physical health... food is the foundation of your physique.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.04,0:59:21.43,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Important for building your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.68,0:59:26.52,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Haruka-chan supports Shizuku in ways like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.52,0:59:28.74,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.74,0:59:33.51,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Those veggies look really fresh and delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.52,0:59:37.08,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And last up is Airi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.08,0:59:41.08,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}For Airi-chan, we only have the untrained art.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.08,0:59:42.84,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Isn't she cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.84,0:59:45.59,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}When you think of Airi-chan, you think of the midriff look.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.72,0:59:50.44,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Airi-chan is so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.00,0:59:52.00,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And that wink!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.08,0:59:57.90,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}It really gives you a burst of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.90,0:59:58.84,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Super cute.
Comment: 0,0:59:58.84,0:59:59.96,Shizuku - PiP,,0,0,0,,Below translation is missing heso
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.96,1:00:02.58,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Airi-chan sure has a lot of midriff in her outfits.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.58,1:00:03.76,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I'm not complaining.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.52,1:00:08.36,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Everyone looks so good in these outfits.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.36,1:00:11.04,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I'm so glad we could look at them together.
Comment: 0,1:00:12.77,1:00:13.27,Shizuku - PiP,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.16,1:00:20.16,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And with that, that was all the cards for this event.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.84,1:00:21.68,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.68,1:00:25.60,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Someone mentioned this in the comments earlier, but for this time...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.60,1:00:26.88,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}What was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.88,1:00:27.88,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}The team name.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.88,1:00:29.94,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I made it "Fabulous."
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.94,1:00:33.40,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Everyone really is fabulous. That sums it up in one word.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.08,1:00:37.04,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.80,1:00:42.52,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Anyway, there was something else I wanted to mention.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.52,1:00:43.92,Shizuku - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}So earlier I...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.67,1:00:47.57,Shizuku,,0,0,0,,I touched on this earlier, but where did I leave off?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.74,1:00:50.40,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I remember talking about my favorite scenes,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.40,1:00:55.16,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,and how our voices miraculously synced up in the "Grand Fleur" commercial.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.72,1:00:56.80,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,And so... ah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.80,1:00:57.65,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.52,1:01:07.05,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,In the story, when Shizuku was auditioning for the "Grand Fleur" commercial,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.05,1:01:11.34,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,she was watching Hagiyama-chan's performance.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.34,1:01:18.88,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Shizuku saw that powerful light of hers and realized, "This is what I'm lacking." There was a scene like that, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.44,1:01:26.22,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I really empathized with Shizuku there.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.22,1:01:32.36,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,In the many activities I'm lucky enough to participate in,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.36,1:01:36.36,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,there are so many times when I'm faced with my own shortcomings.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.36,1:01:42.20,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'm made aware of where I'm lacking, and I run into those walls,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.20,1:01:47.68,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,but I don't know what exactly I should be doing to overcome those.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.68,1:01:49.60,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'm like, "What do I do!"
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.36,1:01:55.28,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Honestly, I could even call this one of my life's biggest challenges.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.04,1:01:58.55,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'm very blessed in this line of work,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.55,1:02:04.47,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,having the opportunity to be around so many cool and amazing people.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.72,1:02:09.95,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,But because of that, I notice they have things that I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.95,1:02:10.80,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,In other words...
Comment: 0,1:02:12.04,1:02:16.28,Shizuku,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.04,1:02:16.28,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,They shine so brightly and have charms that I don't have.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.36,1:02:23.66,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,And when I'm struggling like that, it can sometimes feel like being deep under the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.66,1:02:31.18,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,struggling in the dark where I can't see what's ahead. It's just so painful.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.18,1:02:32.28,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It's really tough.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.00,1:02:37.88,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It's like everything you do backfires, or you just don't see any results.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.88,1:02:43.80,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Maybe some of you feel the same way too.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.14,1:02:46.88,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I have those really painful times too.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.88,1:02:47.64,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,But you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.52,1:02:55.16,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,sometimes there's a moment when you suddenly realize, "Oh, that's it!"
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.16,1:02:59.14,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Like, "This is what I was looking for all along."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.14,1:03:05.55,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It's strange, but you only understand it once you've actually found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.56,1:03:14.94,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'm sorry if I'm not explaining this well, I'm struggling to find the right words,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.94,1:03:16.72,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,but in my experience...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.40,1:03:22.76,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,it's something you only realize once you find that light, like "Oh, this was it."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.68,1:03:29.10,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,You can't see it while you're struggling; only the "you" who found it can know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.10,1:03:39.79,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,So for those of you who might be struggling right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.79,1:03:45.92,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,it might be tough right now, but one day that light will be in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.56,1:03:48.74,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It will come. I guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.74,1:03:50.02,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Take it from me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.02,1:03:55.68,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I want this to be a world where everyone can reach that light.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.20,1:04:08.88,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,That's a theme I personally wanted to convey through this story and through Shizuku herself.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.88,1:04:10.60,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,So let's all keep doing our best.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.60,1:04:18.04,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Whether it's club activities, work, or job hunting,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.04,1:04:21.68,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I know things can get tough.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.68,1:04:27.72,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,So I hope you can take a chance to relax by watching ProSeka stories and listening to the songs.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.72,1:04:33.68,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'd be so happy if they could be a source of strength or healing for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.36,1:04:39.34,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,When you lack confidence... Shizuku was like that too, wasn't she?
Comment: 0,1:04:39.34,1:04:55.56,Shizuku,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.34,1:04:44.48,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Shizuku was happy to pass the "Grand Fleur" audition,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.48,1:04:54.72,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,but she didn't know what she needed to do to reach a level worthy of performing alongside Hagiyama-san,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.72,1:04:57.71,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,so she was nervous for the actual recording.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.76,1:05:05.44,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It's really scary having to face a challenge right in front of you when you feel you're not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.28,1:05:12.72,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I really empathized with that Shizuku feeling so uncertain in herself.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.32,1:05:16.32,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, and one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.32,1:05:16.95,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,You see...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.20,1:05:23.27,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,When she was watching Hagiyama-chan's performance during the audition,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.68,1:05:32.40,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Shizuku felt her unyielding will to never lose or back down.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.40,1:05:40.10,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Then during the costume fitting, Hagiyama-chan asked Shizuku what she was thinking about during the audition.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.10,1:05:49.52,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,And Shizuku said she wanted to give a performance that would surpass her opponent.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.52,1:05:53.52,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,That really struck a chord with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.52,1:06:00.12,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'm lucky to have the opportunity to do lots of different auditions,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.12,1:06:04.12,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,but I get so nervous and put a lot of pressure on myself.
Comment: 0,1:06:04.12,1:06:04.12,Shizuku,,0,0,0,,Review translation below
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.12,1:06:08.38,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,And since it's such a wonderful project,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.70,1:06:14.82,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I worry about whether I might hold the production back, or my acting was any good,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.82,1:06:17.38,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,or if I'll be a burden to my co-stars.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.38,1:06:18.78,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,All these different thoughts go through my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.78,1:06:23.15,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,There are times when I feel like I might fold under those doubts.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.15,1:06:33.48,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,But in those moments, if I had that will to never lose or back down, I felt like I could stand much firmer as myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.48,1:06:35.54,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Hagiyama-chan is seriously so strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.54,1:06:36.68,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,She's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.36,1:06:40.36,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I ended up learning a lot too, just like Shizuku.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.88,1:06:49.20,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I felt like if I had a heart that strong, I might even grow wings myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.20,1:06:51.18,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I could take flight, just like Shizuku.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.18,1:06:52.52,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'll do my best too.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.52,1:06:54.08,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'm counting on your support!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.08,1:06:56.51,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,That's what I wanted to share.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.96,1:07:00.82,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Seriously though, I learn a lot from ProSeka stories.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.82,1:07:06.84,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,They teach me so much. I feel like they're even a source of emotional support for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.84,1:07:07.80,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.52,1:07:14.06,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'd be so happy if the stories resonate with all of you as well.
Comment: 0,1:07:15.64,1:07:17.72,Shizuku,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.64,1:07:17.72,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Everyone's saying "Let's do our best!"
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.72,1:07:18.48,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.20,1:07:22.05,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Let's all grow together! Supporting each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.05,1:07:22.56,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Thank you—
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.56,1:07:24.76,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,"I'm rooting for you—" Thank you for the support.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.76,1:07:26.16,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'll do my best too.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.16,1:07:29.20,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,In my heart, I'm always right there with Shizuku.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.16,1:07:34.02,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,So, I think I got everything out that I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.02,1:07:37.67,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I had notes on everything I wanted to talk about, and I've managed to say it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.76,1:07:40.90,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.90,1:07:43.22,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Thank you for sticking with me for so long.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.22,1:07:50.72,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,The "Hashiru! Tooku! Todoku!" 3DMV is also out, so please check it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.72,1:07:53.08,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, sorry, I got that wrong. Was it the 2DMV?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.88,1:07:59.78,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,The 2DMV was just uploaded to the official YouTube channel, so please go watch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.78,1:08:00.80,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It was the 2DMV.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.80,1:08:01.75,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.56,1:08:03.96,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Please check it out!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.60,1:08:14.92,Comment,host,0,0,0,,I had to listen to this 20 times to untangle everything 💀
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.60,1:08:09.92,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Both the 2DMV and the 3DMV, and the 2D— 2DMV
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.92,1:08:11.46,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Hehe. Let me try that again.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.46,1:08:14.22,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Both the 3DMV and the 2DMV for—
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.22,1:08:14.92,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.92,1:08:23.60,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,{\i1}Both{\i0} the 3DMV and the 2DMV for "Hashiru! Tooku! Todoku!" were just released on the official YouTube channel.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.80,1:08:28.36,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm always getting so flustered. My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.52,1:08:30.56,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'm also going to watch them.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.56,1:08:34.90,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Once this stream is over, please watch them as much as you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.90,1:08:36.18,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I'd really appreciate it!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.18,1:08:37.14,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.14,1:08:40.22,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone! Everyone's saying they're going to watch it.
Comment: 0,1:08:40.22,1:08:41.54,Shizuku,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.22,1:08:41.54,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.54,1:08:52.76,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,And with that, it's time to wrap up this episode of ProSeka AfterTalk: "Grow Glorious Glow" edition!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.76,1:08:55.42,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,To everyone watching the stream, how did you like it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.42,1:09:01.72,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Wow, seeing all your supportive comments has made me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.24,1:09:05.27,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,MMJ really is the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.56,1:09:08.50,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,They just keep on growing more and more.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.50,1:09:13.96,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,It's been amazing to see them keep surpassing themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.68,1:09:18.40,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Thank you all so much, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.40,1:09:19.30,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I had so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.30,1:09:20.68,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,I really did.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.48,1:09:26.38,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Anyway, about "Grow Glorious Glow"... that's a bit of a tongue twister!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.38,1:09:30.92,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,If you haven't finished reading "Grow Glorious Glow" yet,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.92,1:09:38.22,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,you can read it all in the Event Stories menu once the next event starts.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.22,1:09:40.72,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,So please, read it over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.72,1:09:47.46,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,The scenes I mentioned earlier that we didn't get to watch together today are all in there,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.46,1:09:51.80,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,so I'd be happy if you think, "Oh, Hon-chan mentioned this part!" while you're reading.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.32,1:09:53.44,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Please check it out!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.56,1:09:59.42,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Well then, thank you all so much for sticking with me today.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.42,1:10:01.26,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,See you again next time!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.26,1:10:02.00,Shizuku,host,0,0,0,,Bye bye!
